# Snippets are embedded in the documentation by DocC, which renders the first
# contiguous comment block of a snippet as its description and treats
# `// snippet.*` line comments as markers. Keep the license header out of these
# files, and leave the marker comments alone.
#
# Snippets read as documentation, so they keep aligned trailing comments and
# inline `try` expressions that the main sources would hoist.
--header ignore
--disable docComments, blankLinesBetweenScopes, consecutiveSpaces, hoistTry
